// # RFC Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the 8 accepted RFCs. Read in numeric order; the order
//          reflects importance.
//
// Setup: This file lives in rfcs/. Resolve every beat path from
//        this file's directory. Do not prefix openOODA/ or rfcs/.
//        Imports register the 8 RFC siblings. Numeric order
//        reflects criticality, not chronology.
//
// Beats:
//   1. 0000-template.oot — the format for writing new RFCs.
//   2. 0001-capability-security.oot — the security model (Implemented).
//   3. 0002-design-by-contract.oot — the type-system correctness primitive
//      (Implemented).
//   4. 0003-file-format.oot — Academy header, 256 cap, ASD-STE100.
//   5. 0004-engineering-model.oot — the 3-layer architecture and
//      E-M formulation.
//   6. 0005-tactical-subsystem-template.oot — the template every
//      subsystem follows.
//   7. 0006-versioning-and-release-protocol.oot — tag = VERSION = release
//      invariant + release_tag= field.
//   8. 0007-blackbox-flight-recorder.oot — execution flight recorder
//      and crash autopsy engine.

import "0000-template.oot";
import "0001-capability-security.oot";
import "0002-design-by-contract.oot";
import "0003-file-format.oot";
import "0004-engineering-model.oot";
import "0005-tactical-subsystem-template.oot";
